A||||1||ChadMan||Will 84-87 4-banger exhaust fit an 88?||||1||
Z||000000||ChadMan||06-28-2000||09:48 AM||||I'm thinking of replacing the mangled exhaust on my 88 Coupe from the cat back with an unmangled exhaust system from a friend's 84 parts car.  Does anybody know if it will fit, what with the different cradles and all?<P>Thanks in advance...||||reg||1
Z||000001||turbo86se||06-28-2000||10:26 AM||||I think they should. Since you have an 88 with the dual cutouts on the rear fascia, I'd try to find an exhaust system from a V6 Fiero. This way you'd have dual outlets. Looks better to me IMHO  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I did this on my 88 coupe, I took an exhaust system from an 86SE V6, and put it on my 88 coupe. Fit perfectly! I also took an 85SEV6 exhaust and installed it on my 86SEV6.<BR>||||reg||1
